      "content": "It's been too long since you stopped moving for him, and now the silence is just another way to end it.\nYou don't have to carry the ghost anymore; let the chair hold you while your hands finally rest without effort.\nThere is no point in trying to find a purpose that no longer exists, so why not let the quiet take you?",
